WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.576 --> 00:00:06.893
- I spent a lot of time in
my 20's waiting for someone

00:00:06.893 --> 00:00:08.741
to tell me that it was my time,

00:00:08.741 --> 00:00:10.360
and expecting someone to say,

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:12.767
okay I'm gonna step aside
and now it's your turn,

00:00:12.767 --> 00:00:14.716
and that's not a thing,

00:00:14.716 --> 00:00:17.054
so you need to make your own time

00:00:17.054 --> 00:00:18.478
and take your own turn.

00:00:18.478 --> 00:00:20.722
- Mistakes are okay as long
as they don't kill you.

00:00:20.722 --> 00:00:23.591
Things change, so live
your life in chapters.

00:00:23.591 --> 00:00:25.556
- Don't compare yourself to other people.

00:00:25.556 --> 00:00:27.697
Realize that you don't know
what people are going through,

00:00:27.697 --> 00:00:30.585
so don't think that
everyone is better than you.

00:00:30.585 --> 00:00:32.816
- I would tell myself that
I deserve good things,

00:00:32.816 --> 00:00:34.846
I deserve to be loved and happy,

00:00:34.846 --> 00:00:36.989
and have people in my life who like me

00:00:36.989 --> 00:00:39.301
for all my weird quirks.

00:00:39.301 --> 00:00:41.609
- If I had known that
I would be the person

00:00:41.609 --> 00:00:43.756
that I am today without them,

00:00:43.756 --> 00:00:45.406
I would've left a long time ago.

00:00:45.406 --> 00:00:48.328
That is when I really
learned that it is okay

00:00:48.328 --> 00:00:49.381
to be selfish.

00:00:49.381 --> 00:00:50.214
- Don't stop playing piano

00:00:50.214 --> 00:00:51.768
just because you found another passion.

00:00:51.768 --> 00:00:53.581
Keep two passions, keep too many passions.

00:00:53.581 --> 00:00:55.825
- I think it's important to
realize that everybody is human

00:00:55.825 --> 00:00:57.377
and has limited experiences,

00:00:57.377 --> 00:00:58.663
no one is an authority.

00:00:58.663 --> 00:01:00.810
- You know better than
anyone what's best for you.

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:03.186
- It is completely okay to be weird.

00:01:03.186 --> 00:01:07.027
I have been very accustomed
to being the odd one out,

00:01:07.027 --> 00:01:10.228
and it led me to the best things possible.

00:01:10.228 --> 00:01:11.484
- If you feel it in your heart,

00:01:11.484 --> 00:01:14.125
and you believe it's right, lean into it.

00:01:14.125 --> 00:01:16.083
- [Wavy Hair Girl] Don't
try to change yourself

00:01:16.083 --> 00:01:17.592
for other people.

00:01:17.592 --> 00:01:19.675
- Your curls are amazing!

